  "question": {
    "text": "Two poles of height <math><mn>10</mn></math> meters and <math><mn>20</mn></math> meters stand at the centres of two circular plots which touch each other externally at a point and the two poles subtend angles&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> respectively at this point, then the distance between the centres of these circular plots is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>30</mn></math> meters",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> meters",
